# A guest punches a standing mannequin; the host punches one that walks a route.
scenario mannequin_hits
scene mannequin
seed 13
guests 1
settle 8s

net g1 rtt 120ms jitter 20ms loss 2%

p1 punch dummy as dummy
at 1400ms p0 punch walker as walker

expect result dummy hit
expect result walker hit
expect echo_ticks.max <= 120t
expect effects_once
expect agree_at_rest 5cm 5deg
expect no_stuck
